    <peripheral>
      <name>PHY_MEMORY</name>
      <description>Shared PHY table-memory command, data and PBUS group-boundary aperture.
        The same command/data words have mode-dependent PBUS-memory, TX-CFR and
        gain-memory meanings; fields are named only where the complete bodies
        prove a common or mode-independent identity.</description>
