        </register>
        <register>
          <name>SCHEDULER_LOCK_MODIFY_REQUEST</name>
          <description>The scheduler insert-with-lock-modify path publishes START with a compressed SRAM pointer. Before and after publication it may progress whenever either START or SCHEDULER_STATE.BUSY is clear. When that publication wait ends it reports zero when BUSY is clear, otherwise the positional four-bit RESULT image returned in bits 30:27; this is not radio-item completion.</description>
