      <description>One independently bounded shared-baseband reset-idle status word. The complete
Bluetooth bbmac_idle_for_swrst leaf proves the exact predicate, but its location
inside another protocol aperture prevents Bluetooth-exclusive ownership.</description>
      <baseAddress>0x20103088</baseAddress>
      <registers>
        <register>
          <name>STATUS</name>
