    <peripheral>
      <name>BLE_PHY_INIT_TOGGLE</name>
      <description>Narrow owner for the otherwise unbounded word at 0x20101FF0. Complete
ESP32-S31 BLE PHY initialization writes zero and then one before touching any
other radio register. The same ordered operation appears at the same block
offset in the named ESP32-C61 counterpart, but neither artifact proves that
this word belongs to the adjacent BTMAC dump range. No wider peripheral extent
or reset/enable interpretation is claimed.
</description>
