    <peripheral>
      <name>BLE_CONTROLLER_ADDRESS_SLOTS</name>
      <description>Three positional six-byte controller address slots. A complete ESP32-S31
ble_phy.c leaf proves the selector range, pair stride, byte packing and write
order. Named callers identify public-address use of slot zero and
random-address use of slot one; slot two remains intentionally unnamed.
</description>
